<h1 id="javascript">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#javascript"></a>
JavaScript
</h1><h2 id="1导入方式">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#1%e5%af%bc%e5%85%a5%e6%96%b9%e5%bc%8f"></a>
1.导入方式:
</h2><h3 id="同样有三种">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#%e5%90%8c%e6%a0%b7%e6%9c%89%e4%b8%89%e7%a7%8d"></a>
